I built the issue desk in `src/main.ts` (tabs and mount), with `src/issues.ts`, `src/help.ts`, `src/settings.ts` and a shared `src/shared.ts`, all plain TypeScript and DOM. `./check` is clean and all 30 visible tests pass (4 of 15 runs used). I was unsure about a few judgment calls: the assign error shows the bare server message as the brief literally says, a failed help search clears its hits, an empty user name blocks assign and post, and a browser console 404 appears during the test run that I could not trace to the app, so it may be the favicon.